  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Down to Zero: Building Back Better in times of Covid-19</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme will build and expand on the Alliance&amp;rsquo;s collective achievements to date, scaling up the 2016-2020 Down to Zero (DtZ) programme and being complementary to the 2020-2021 Voice for Change (VfC) programme. This will allow the Alliance and its partners to effectively address SEC in the rapidly evolving context during and after the Covid-19 pandemic.
&amp;nbsp;</narrative>
  </description>
